{
  "sn6.14:0.1": "Saṁyutta Nikāya 6.14 ",
  "sn6.14:0.2": "2. Dutiyavagga ",
  "sn6.14:0.3": "Aruṇavatīsutta ",
  "sn6.14:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "sn6.14:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati …pe… ",
  "sn6.14:1.3": "tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "sn6.14:1.4": "“bhikkhavo”ti. ",
  "sn6.14:1.5": "“Bhadante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "sn6.14:1.6": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "sn6.14:2.1": "“Bhūtapubbaṁ, bhikkhave, rājā ahosi aruṇavā nāma. ",
  "sn6.14:2.2": "Rañño kho pana, bhikkhave, aruṇavato aruṇavatī nāma rājadhānī ahosi. ",
  "sn6.14:2.3": "Aruṇavatiṁ kho pana, bhikkhave, rājadhāniṁ sikhī bhagavā arahaṁ sammāsambuddho upanissāya vihāsi. ",
  "sn6.14:2.4": "Sikhissa kho pana, bhikkhave, bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa abhibhūsambhavaṁ nāma sāvakayugaṁ ahosi aggaṁ bhaddayugaṁ. ",
  "sn6.14:2.5": "Atha kho, bhikkhave, sikhī bhagavā arahaṁ sammāsambuddho abhibhuṁ bhikkhuṁ āmantesi: ",
  "sn6.14:2.6": "‘āyāma, brāhmaṇa, yena aññataro brahmaloko tenupasaṅkamissāma, yāva bhattassa kālo bhavissatī’ti. ",
  "sn6.14:2.7": "‘Evaṁ, bhante’ti kho bhikkhave, abhibhū bhikkhu sikhissa bhagavato arahato sammāsambuddhassa paccassosi. ",
  "sn6.14:2.8": "Atha kho, bhikkhave, sikhī bhagavā arahaṁ sammāsambuddho abhibhū ca bhikkhu—seyyathāpi nāma balavā puriso samiñjitaṁ vā bāhaṁ pasāreyya, pasāritaṁ vā bāhaṁ samiñjeyya; evameva—aruṇavat